  "description": "Away from the Sun is the second studio album by the American rock band 3 Doors Down, released by Universal Records on November 12, 2002. Three of its four singles—\"When I'm Gone\", \"Here Without You\", and \"Away from the Sun\"—entered the Billboard Hot 100, peaking at numbers four, five, and 62, respectively. The album received quadruple platinum certification by the Recording Industry Association of America (RIAA) on August 4, 2006.",
